Package: anbernic-rg353x-audio-utils
Architecture: all
Depends: bash, alsa-utils, init-system-helpers (>= 1.54~), ${misc:Depends}
Provides: anbernic-rg353x-headphone-detect
Conflicts: anbernic-rg353x-headphone-detect, anbernic-rg353x-alsa-ucm, rg353-headphone-detect
Replaces: anbernic-rg353x-headphone-detect, anbernic-rg353x-alsa-ucm, rg353-headphone-detect
Description: Audio utilities and jack detection daemon for Anbernic RG353 series
 Audio support utilities for Anbernic RG353 series handhelds (RG353V, RG353VS,
 RG353M, RG353P) running RK3566 + RK817 codec under Linux/Armbian.
 Includes automatic headphone jack detection daemon and PipeWire/WirePlumber
 tuning configuration.
